<BRK/>
<TAI OPT="INDOOR AIR QUALITY"><NTE><AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  The following two submittal items are tailored for INDOOR AIR QUALITY.  Include the following submittal 
when required by Section <SRF>01 33 29</SRF> SUSTAINABILITY REQUIREMENTS AND REPORTING, IAQ requirements.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
[<ITM><SUB>Final IAQ Management Plan</SUB>; <SUB>S</SUB></ITM><BRK/>
